  "worked_solution": "The orthogonal projection of $a$ onto $\\text{Span}{b}$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{b}\\,a & =\\frac{b\\cdot a}{b\\cdot b}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1\\cdot 2+1\\cdot 2+0\\cdot (-1)+1\\cdot 5}{{1}^{2}+{1}^{2}+{0}^{2}+{1}^{2}}b \\\\  & =\\frac{2+2+0+5}{1+1+0+1}b \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{3}b \\\\  & =3b \\\\  & =3[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$",
